INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0001','Marketing Property Listings in Nairobi: A Practical Playbook','marketing-property-listings-in-nairobi','Digital Marketing','PUBLISHED','Good photos are not enough to move a listing. Here is a step-by-step approach to presenting, promoting and following up on Nairobi property leads.','Real estate is where AdConnect started, and the same lessons keep coming up. A listing does not sell itself, even in a busy market like Nairobi. Buyers and tenants compare several options on their phones before they ever call an agent, so your listing has to answer their questions quickly.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0002','WhatsApp Business for Small Kenyan Brands','whatsapp-business-for-kenyan-small-brands','Digital Marketing','PUBLISHED','Many Kenyan customers prefer to chat before they buy. Learn how to set up WhatsApp Business so it feels professional and actually brings in sales.','For many Kenyan customers, WhatsApp is the first place to ask a question. If your business only lists a phone number and hopes for calls, you may be missing people who simply prefer to type. WhatsApp Business is free to start and gives small brands tools that a personal account does not.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0003','Local SEO Basics for Service Businesses in Kenya','local-seo-basics-for-service-businesses','Digital Marketing','PUBLISHED','If customers search for your service near them, you want to appear. These local SEO fundamentals are free to start and compound over time.','When someone types "plumber in Westlands" or "dental clinic near me", search engines try to show nearby, trusted businesses. Local SEO is the work of making your business an obvious answer. It takes patience, but the basics cost little more than time.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0004','Making Websites Fast on Mobile Data','making-websites-fast-on-mobile-data','Web Development','PUBLISHED','Many Kenyan visitors browse on phones and limited bundles. These practical changes make your site lighter and quicker without a full rebuild.','A large share of web visitors in Kenya arrive on a phone, often with limited data and a connection that changes from one street to the next. A site designed on a fast office connection can feel painfully slow in those conditions. The good news is that most speed problems come from a few repeat offenders.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0005','Website or Web App: Which Do You Actually Need?','website-or-web-app-which-do-you-need','Web Development','PUBLISHED','Not every business needs a custom application. Here is how to tell whether a simple website, an online store or a full web app fits your goals.','One of the first questions we ask new clients is what they want people to do online. The answer decides whether you need a website, an online shop or a web application. Choosing the wrong one means paying for features you do not use or outgrowing a tool far too soon.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0006','Integrating M-Pesa Daraja Into Your App: What to Plan For','integrating-mpesa-daraja-into-your-app','Software Development','PUBLISHED','Accepting M-Pesa payments in your own system takes more than an API call. Plan for callbacks, reconciliation, failures and testing before you go live.','For many Kenyan businesses, accepting M-Pesa inside their own app or website is a basic requirement. Safaricom''s Daraja platform provides APIs for this, but a reliable integration involves more than sending a request. Here is what to plan for before you write code.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0007','Build Small Internal Tools Before Big Software','build-internal-tools-before-big-software','Software Development','PUBLISHED','A lightweight internal tool can remove daily friction long before you need a large system. Here is how to choose, build and grow one safely.','Many growing businesses run on a patchwork of spreadsheets, chat messages and memory. It works until it does not. The instinct is to buy or build a large system, but that is often a costly leap. A small internal tool aimed at one painful task can deliver most of the benefit for a fraction of the effort.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0008','Designing Software Around Real Workflows','designing-software-around-real-workflows','Software Design','PUBLISHED','Software that mirrors how people actually work gets used. Learn a simple approach to mapping workflows, entities and rules before any code is written.','Many software projects struggle not because the code is poor but because the design does not match how people work. Screens are built from a feature list, and then staff invent workarounds. A little design effort up front prevents this.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0009','Database Backups and Recovery: The Basics Every Business Needs','database-backups-and-recovery-basics','Database Management','PUBLISHED','A backup you have never restored is only a hope. Here is how to set up sensible backups, test them and know what to do when something goes wrong.','Your customer records, orders and invoices probably live in a database. If it is lost, corrupted or encrypted by ransomware, how long could your business keep operating? Backups are the answer, but only if they are done properly and tested.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0010','Running a Simple Technology Audit for Your Business','running-a-simple-technology-audit','Consulting','PUBLISHED','Before buying new tools, take stock of what you already use. A short audit shows where money leaks, where risks hide and what to fix first.','Most businesses accumulate technology gradually: a website built years ago, a few subscriptions, shared passwords, a spreadsheet that became critical. Nobody planned it as a system. A simple audit turns this pile into a clear picture and a short action list.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0011','Reading Your Marketing Numbers Without Being Fooled','reading-your-marketing-numbers-without-being-fooled','Data & Statistics','PUBLISHED','Clicks and impressions look impressive but do not pay the bills. Learn which marketing numbers matter and how to avoid common statistical traps.','Every advertising platform gives you dashboards full of numbers. It is easy to feel informed while actually learning very little. With a few statistical habits, you can read your results more honestly and make better decisions.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0012','Survey Basics: Sample Size, Bias and Asking Better Questions','survey-basics-sample-size-and-bias','Data & Statistics','PUBLISHED','A survey can guide real decisions or mislead you confidently. Here is how to plan one, avoid common biases and interpret the results with care.','Surveys are a cheap way to learn what customers think, but a badly designed one produces confident nonsense. Whether you are asking clients about service quality or testing interest in a new product, a few principles from statistics make a big difference.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0013','Budgeting for Digital Marketing in KES: A Simple Framework','budgeting-digital-marketing-in-kes','Business','PUBLISHED','How much should a small business spend on digital marketing? A simple framework helps you set a budget, split it sensibly and review it with honest numbers.','Business owners often ask what they should spend on digital marketing. There is no universal figure, because it depends on your margins, your goals and how quickly you want to grow. What helps is a clear way to think about it, so spending is a decision rather than a guess.
INSERT IGNORE INTO blog_posts (id,title,slug,category,status,excerpt,content,author,cover_image,view_count,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('smp-blog0014','Choosing a Digital Partner for Your Business','choosing-a-digital-partner-for-your-business','Business','PUBLISHED','Hiring a freelancer or agency is a big trust decision. These questions help you compare options, protect ownership and set up a healthy working relationship.','Sooner or later most businesses need outside help with their website, marketing or software. Choosing a partner is partly about skills and partly about trust. A wrong choice can cost months and leave you with work you cannot use, so it pays to be deliberate.
